# The #5266 mechanism: an entry whose batch decision arrived first is applied below the check.
MODULE: StoredValidWhenJudgedLatePrepareUnjudged
TARGET: StoredValidWhenJudged
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an entry settled against an earlier decision skips judgement
PERTURBS: Deliver

--- FIND
    /\ cur' = e /\ rphase' = "Judging" /\ judged' = 0
--- REPLACE
    /\ cur' = e /\ rphase' = (IF late[e] THEN "Committing" ELSE "Judging") /\ judged' = 0
--- END